tate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Takaya_at_Motor_City_in_Dubai_d5495dad41.jpg","744x":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/744x/Takaya_at_Motor_City_in_Dubai_d5495dad41.webp","376x512":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/376x512/Takaya_at_Motor_City_in_Dubai_d5495dad41.webp"}]},{"rank":null,"slug":"kaya-arada-properties-tilal","about":"Kaya is a luxury designer project of exclusive villas by Arada Properties. The development is located in the green forested parkland of Masaar neighborhood in Sharjah.The development consists of 421 homes including townhouses and forest villas with 2-5 bedrooms. All of them are designed in accordance with the philosophical principles of the Sanskrit teachings of Vastu Shastra, uniting architecture with nature. The complex is located in the heart of Masaar, providing easy access to the park and outdoor sports facilities. All the houses are equipped with smart home technology. Some mansions are equipped with elevators, swimming pools, spacious living rooms with bedrooms and large terraces to admire the surroundings.Life at Arada Kaya is lived at a slower pace. This allows residents to recover from a busy day and spend more time taking care of themselves and spending time with loved ones. Living in an ecologically friendly forest environment lends itself to outdoor activities and sports. There are plenty of opportunities for outdoor activities such as forest walks, picnics, running, cycling and more.Arada Kaya's strategic location in Masaar provides easy access to the city center and popular attractions. Situated near Tilal area, it is well connected to other parts of the city due to its close proximity to Emirates Road, Mleiha Road and other parts of the city. This makes it easy to commute from Sharjah or Dubai without traffic jams.","price":4960000,"title":"Kaya","bitrix":{"id":685,"pf_id":"are.3.11560","source":null,"project_id":"Masaar","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Kaya","property_t